 "remarks": "When opportunity knocks, answer the door. Nestled on a highly sought-after cul-de-sac in the heart of Silvermine, 5 Green Hill Road offers the perfect canvas to create the home of your dreams. With vision, a paintbrush, and a little sweat equity, this expansive Ranch-style abode can be transformed into something truly special. Set amidst the tranquility and charm that make Silvermine one of the area's most desirable locations, this home provides the ideal backdrop for creating memories that will last a lifetime. Inside, you'll find generous living spaces, spacious bedrooms, two cozy fireplaces, a two-car garage, and the peace of mind that comes with an automatic whole-house generator. Come customize your forever home or capitalize on a rare opportunity in an exceptional location, 5 Green Hill delivers unlimited potential. Enjoy the perfect balance of privacy, neighborhood charm, and convenient access to commuting routes. Opportunities like this are few and far between. Come discover the possibilities and envision your future at 5 Green Hill Road, a place you'll be proud to call home. Back on market due to buyer's inability to obtain financing. No fault of the seller.",
